.TH RECT_CENTERED 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
rect_centered \- Build a Rect of the given size centered on c: the hitbox of an entity whose pos is its center, or a pickup radius as a box
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqcollide.h\(dq
.BI "Rect rect_centered(Vec2 c, float w, float h);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Build a Rect of the given size centered on c: the hitbox of an entity whose pos is its center, or a pickup radius as a box.
.PP
This is a static inline function; it is defined in the header.
.SH RETURN VALUE
the Rect.
.SH MODULE
math (src/engine/math/collide.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR rect_at (3),
.BR rect_center (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
